        "content": "## ⚡ Podcast RSS Active Brand Sponsors, Promo Codes & Guest Contact Extractor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nDiscover brands actively paying to sponsor podcasts via promo code detection in episode show notes, plus host booking emails.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/podcast-rss-sponsor-guest-extractor`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/podcast-rss-sponsor-guest-extractor) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Podcast RSS Sponsor, Promo & Guest Extractor** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract live structured JSON records!",
